"Netscape Plugin dde^? hie^?n thi. no^.i dung dda(.c bii.et nhu+ Navigator la`m ."
"Xin chu' y' la` vie^.c ca`i dda(.t ca'c plugin ra sao la` do distrobution cu?a ba.n ."
